 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Every foggy night,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.245
  },
  {
   "text": "this railwayman walks out onto the tracks,",
   "s": 1.506,
   "e": 3.835
  },
  {
   "text": "and straps bombs to the rails.",
   "s": 3.961,
   "e": 5.714
  },
  {
   "text": "It's England,",
   "s": 6.371,
   "e": 6.994
  },
  {
   "text": "in the eighteen-forties.",
   "s": 7.216,
   "e": 8.287
  },
  {
   "text": "Steam trains thunder through the countryside,",
   "s": 8.738,
   "e": 11.723
  },
  {
   "text": "faster than anything on earth.",
   "s": 11.858,
   "e": 12.735
  },
  {
   "text": "But when the fog rolls in,",
   "s": 13.362,
   "e": 14.572
  },
  {
   "text": "the drivers can't see a thing.",
   "s": 14.79,
   "e": 16.337
  },
  {
   "text": "Not the signals.",
   "s": 16.826,
   "e": 17.721
  },
  {
   "text": "Not the lamps.",
   "s": 17.862,
   "e": 18.595
  },
  {
   "text": "Not even a train stopped right ahead.",
   "s": 18.951,
   "e": 20.745
  },
  {
   "text": "So a young engineer has an idea.",
   "s": 21.4,
   "e": 23.592
  },
  {
   "text": "Little bombs,",
   "s": 24.2,
   "e": 25.068
  },
  {
   "text": "the size of a coin.",
   "s": 25.262,
   "e": 26.114
  },
  {
   "text": "His bosses think he's lost his mind.",
   "s": 26.785,
   "e": 28.555
  },
  {
   "text": "Explosives?",
   "s": 28.965,
   "e": 29.893
  },
  {
   "text": "On the track?",
   "s": 30.108,
   "e": 30.871
  },
  {
   "text": "Under a moving train?",
   "s": 31.131,
   "e": 32.407
  },
  {
   "text": "But he clips one to the rail,",
   "s": 32.998,
   "e": 34.353
  },
  {
   "text": "and waits.",
   "s": 34.606,
   "e": 35.219
  },
  {
   "text": "Out of the fog,",
   "s": 35.936,
   "e": 36.723
  },
  {
   "text": "a train comes roaring in.",
   "s": 36.845,
   "e": 38.377
  },
  {
   "text": "The wheel rolls over it,",
   "s": 38.82,
   "e": 40.329
  },
  {
   "text": "and bang!",
   "s": 40.503,
   "e": 40.936
  },
  {
   "text": "The driver can't see a thing,",
   "s": 41.535,
   "e": 42.844
  },
  {
   "text": "but he definitely hears that.",
   "s": 43.02,
   "e": 44.527
  },
  {
   "text": "He slams on the brakes, and stops just in time.",
   "s": 44.971,
   "e": 47.524
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 48.15,
   "e": 48.505
  },
  {
   "text": "a bang travels where light can't.",
   "s": 48.753,
   "e": 50.837
  },
  {
   "text": "Fog can hide a lamp,",
   "s": 51.372,
   "e": 52.535
  },
  {
   "text": "but it can't hide a bang.",
   "s": 52.843,
   "e": 54.114
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the crazy part.",
   "s": 54.627,
   "e": 55.712
  },
  {
   "text": "They still use them today.",
   "s": 56.133,
   "e": 57.509
  },
  {
   "text": "Modern trains, computer signals,",
   "s": 58.024,
   "e": 60.093
  },
  {
   "text": "and still,",
   "s": 60.333,
   "e": 60.895
  },
  {
   "text": "a tiny bomb on the track.",
   "s": 61.16,
   "e": 62.519
  }
 ]
}